WEBVTT

00:02.177 --> 00:03.547
[ELISA] Ever since I was little,

00:04.097 --> 00:07.177
I've noticed that I'm different
from the other kids my age.

00:07.267 --> 00:09.477
My father may be a normal human,

00:09.557 --> 00:11.647
but my mother is an elf,

00:11.727 --> 00:13.647
so that makes me a half - elf.

00:13.727 --> 00:15.147
-[BOY 1] Oh, what's wrong?
-[GIRL 1] So weird.

00:15.227 --> 00:17.067
[BOY 2] Hey, look at that girl.

00:17.147 --> 00:18.777
[GIRL 2]
Yeah, her ears are so weird.

00:18.857 --> 00:21.107
[ELISA] My classmates
treated me like a freak

00:21.697 --> 00:23.947
and just stared at me from afar.

00:24.027 --> 00:25.077
That's why...

00:25.157 --> 00:26.827
I don't need friends anyway.

00:27.907 --> 00:31.327
At least,
that's what I used to think.

00:34.037 --> 00:35.337
[AMELIA] Oh, wow, look at that!

00:36.087 --> 00:37.417
Their architecture and fashion

00:37.507 --> 00:39.417
is all so different
from our kingdom.

00:40.087 --> 00:41.837
[ARIANE] So this is
what it's like in Alpheria.

00:42.837 --> 00:45.927
This event is also meant to help
improve relations with Arnold.

00:46.007 --> 00:47.347
I wouldn't be surprised

00:47.427 --> 00:48.887
if they're
pulling out all the stops

00:48.977 --> 00:50.177
to make a good impression.

00:50.267 --> 00:51.597
[OLIVIA] You got that right.

00:51.687 --> 00:54.147
Alphelia is known
to be quite conservative,

00:54.227 --> 00:56.607
and they finally opened up
for diplomacy.

00:56.687 --> 00:59.357
This Hymn Festival is sure
to go down in history.

00:59.437 --> 01:01.527
Mmm! Princess Olivia!

01:01.607 --> 01:04.117
Lovely to see you ladies here
on this fine evening.

01:04.197 --> 01:06.117
[REBECCA, ARIANE]
It's been too long, Princess.

01:06.197 --> 01:07.287
Too long.

01:07.367 --> 01:09.157
-By the way, Maria.
-Huh?

01:09.247 --> 01:11.207
Where's my
cute little Ray hiding?

01:11.287 --> 01:12.497
I don't see him.

01:12.917 --> 01:14.417
Oh, uh, well...

01:14.497 --> 01:16.537
-"My cute."
-"Little Ray?"

01:16.627 --> 01:18.007
-[REBECCA] Maria.
-[gasps]

01:19.007 --> 01:20.877
Did you know
something about this?

01:20.967 --> 01:21.927
[Maria gasps]

01:22.337 --> 01:24.587
[MARIA] Oh, well,
we didn't come here together.

01:24.677 --> 01:26.387
-[OLIVIA] I see.
-[CLARIS] Oh, goodness.

01:26.467 --> 01:28.427
I had no idea
the Princess would be here.

01:28.507 --> 01:30.847
Guess if you're
a high enough noble,

01:30.927 --> 01:32.517
even the Princess
can be an acquaintance.

01:32.597 --> 01:35.437
It looks like all the important
people are over there.

01:35.517 --> 01:36.857
Shouldn't she be with them?

01:36.937 --> 01:38.897
-[gasps] Hey, wait.
-[Claris gasps]

01:39.397 --> 01:41.147
-What's this?
-Isn't that...

01:42.277 --> 01:43.487
Ray?

01:43.567 --> 01:45.697
And Elisa?

01:46.907 --> 01:49.327
Hang on.
Why is Elisa over there?

01:49.407 --> 01:51.287
[ELISA] Um, this man.

01:52.077 --> 01:55.037
This man is,
this man is my boyfriend!

01:55.117 --> 01:56.837
[glass shatters]

01:58.457 --> 01:59.837
[♪ opening theme song playing]

02:17.187 --> 02:18.817
-Huh?
-Huh?

02:18.897 --> 02:19.857
-Huh?
-[glass shatters]

02:19.937 --> 02:20.937
-Huh?
-[glass shatters]

02:21.397 --> 02:24.067
[ALL] What?

02:38.827 --> 02:41.207
[RAY] Wait, you're actually
Alpherian royalty?

02:42.047 --> 02:44.717
Apparently,
I'm the fourth princess.

02:44.797 --> 02:47.177
I only recently
found out myself.

02:47.257 --> 02:48.257
[CAROL] Hmm?

02:48.677 --> 02:50.257
But how could that be possible?

02:50.717 --> 02:52.427
It's because of my mother.

02:52.517 --> 02:54.767
She's from the Alpherian
royal family.

02:54.847 --> 02:56.637
But it sounds like
she made a habit

02:56.727 --> 02:58.227
of sneaking out of the country.

02:58.847 --> 03:00.107
That's how she met my father

03:00.187 --> 03:02.227
and ultimately made the decision
to elope with him.

03:02.317 --> 03:05.607
Wow, your mother sounds like
a real firecracker.

03:05.697 --> 03:07.407
Running away together, huh?

03:07.487 --> 03:09.067
It sounds so romantic.

03:09.157 --> 03:10.237
I had no idea.

03:11.117 --> 03:13.157
Still, whether you're royalty
or not,

03:13.247 --> 03:14.497
you're just you to me.

03:14.577 --> 03:16.157
Nothing has to change.

03:17.117 --> 03:18.077
[sighs]

03:19.747 --> 03:21.247
[Carol grunting]

03:21.337 --> 03:22.837
-No, no, no.
-Please just come with me.

03:22.917 --> 03:25.257
We've prepared a room
for each of you for your stay.

03:25.337 --> 03:27.337
But that's not fair.

03:27.427 --> 03:29.297
Yesterday,
we stayed in the same room

03:29.387 --> 03:30.887
-and it was amazing.
-Stop resisting.

03:30.967 --> 03:32.297
-[Carol sobs] No.
-Please behave yourself.

03:32.387 --> 03:34.347
-[CAROL] Ray.
-[sighs]

03:34.427 --> 03:36.267
[MIA] Good news,
I heard your friends from school

03:36.347 --> 03:38.557
were able to enter
the country earlier.

03:38.637 --> 03:41.397
They should be arriving
at the assembly hall soon.

03:41.477 --> 03:42.567
Oh, thanks.

03:42.647 --> 03:44.187
-[knocks on door]
-[BOTH] Huh?

03:44.277 --> 03:45.277
[door opens]

03:46.447 --> 03:48.277
-[ELISA] Um, Ray.
-Oh!

03:48.907 --> 03:51.367
Wow, amazing! In that dress,

03:51.447 --> 03:53.867
you look just like
an elegant fairy or something.

03:54.367 --> 03:56.697
Oh, thank you so much.

03:56.787 --> 03:59.417
-If I may ask.
-What is it?

03:59.497 --> 04:02.127
I'm probably going
to have to introduce myself

04:02.207 --> 04:03.917
to a bunch of important people.

04:03.997 --> 04:06.717
Would you mind
going with me, Ray?

04:06.797 --> 04:08.587
Sure thing. You can count on me.

04:08.667 --> 04:09.627
[sighs]

04:11.847 --> 04:13.967
Is that the famous
Princess Elisa?

04:14.047 --> 04:15.847
Oh, yeah. Lady Saria's daughter.

04:15.927 --> 04:17.677
Apparently,
she's been living in Arnold.

04:18.887 --> 04:20.387
[ABEL] Oh, Elisa.

04:20.477 --> 04:22.187
I'm glad
you could make it tonight.

04:22.267 --> 04:25.107
I am King Abel Alpherius.

04:25.187 --> 04:27.027
It's a pleasure to meet you.

04:27.107 --> 04:30.147
You know, your mother, Saria,
was actually my younger sister.

04:31.107 --> 04:33.447
I suppose that would make me
your uncle then, wouldn't it?

04:33.527 --> 04:35.657
Oh, is that so?

04:35.737 --> 04:38.827
And this
is my younger brother, Cyril.

04:38.907 --> 04:41.287
Greetings.
It's nice to meet you.

04:41.367 --> 04:44.377
-You as well.
-And I'm Crown Prince Rald.

04:44.457 --> 04:46.247
I've been looking forward
to meeting you.

04:47.047 --> 04:49.467
It's an honor to gain
such an adorable little sister.

04:49.547 --> 04:53.007
-Oh, yes, it's nice to meet you.
-Likewise.

04:53.087 --> 04:55.387
[CATHY]
Oh, my gosh! It's really you.

04:55.467 --> 04:58.267
My name's Cathy,
the third princess.

04:58.347 --> 05:00.937
-Uh, right.
-Great to meet you, Elisa.

05:01.017 --> 05:03.397
Ever since I heard that
I have a little sister,

05:03.477 --> 05:05.607
I've wanted to meet you so,
so badly.

05:05.687 --> 05:08.987
An adorable little sister
is an absolute dream come true.

05:09.067 --> 05:11.527
Feel free to call me big sis
from now on.

05:11.607 --> 05:12.527
-[Elisa groans]
-I suppose

05:12.607 --> 05:13.907
you could call me elder sister.

05:13.987 --> 05:15.617
But that sounds way too formal,
don't you think?

05:15.697 --> 05:16.987
-I, uh...
-So what do you say?

05:17.077 --> 05:18.867
Big sis, is it? Am I right?

05:19.327 --> 05:20.447
[ELISA] Um.

05:20.957 --> 05:22.037
Oh, by the way,

05:22.617 --> 05:25.037
in regards to
this human gentleman here.

05:25.127 --> 05:27.747
-Huh?
-What exactly is he to you?

05:27.837 --> 05:29.837
-Right. I am--
-Um...

05:29.917 --> 05:31.257
This man...

05:31.337 --> 05:33.757
This man is,
this man is my boyfriend!

05:33.837 --> 05:37.097
-[echoes] Boyfriend!
-[glasses shattering]

05:37.177 --> 05:39.137
[AMELIA, ARIANE, OLIVIA,
REBECCA] What?

05:39.217 --> 05:40.267
[stutters]

05:40.977 --> 05:42.767
[Elisa whimpers]

05:42.847 --> 05:43.767
[RAY] Hmm?

05:47.687 --> 05:48.857
Yes.

05:48.937 --> 05:51.027
Like she said,
I'm Elisa's boyfriend.

05:53.147 --> 05:54.737
[glasses shattering]

05:56.907 --> 05:59.617
I had clocked her as the timid,
well-behaved type.

05:59.697 --> 06:01.577
Not too bad, little lady.

06:04.287 --> 06:06.037
[LYDIA] Wait, you what?

06:08.127 --> 06:09.917
Can you say that again?

06:10.007 --> 06:12.047
I don't think
I heard you quite right, Ray.

06:12.127 --> 06:13.337
Yes.

06:13.717 --> 06:15.927
Elisa and I ended up pretending
to be in a relationship,

06:16.007 --> 06:18.507
but I don't know
how to act like a boyfriend.

06:18.597 --> 06:19.927
I need your advice.

06:20.507 --> 06:22.177
We only just got to Alpheria

06:22.267 --> 06:24.437
and you're already
stirring up trouble.

06:24.517 --> 06:26.017
What do you think, Abbie?

06:26.687 --> 06:28.397
I'll pass on this one.

06:28.477 --> 06:29.477
[slurps]

06:30.437 --> 06:32.817
Yes, well, I am of course
rich in experience

06:32.897 --> 06:33.947
in these sorts of things.

06:34.027 --> 06:35.777
Nice! You're the best, Master!

06:35.857 --> 06:36.907
[Lydia clears throat]

06:37.527 --> 06:40.197
Say, Carla,
what are your thoughts on this?

06:40.987 --> 06:43.747
You want to act as if
you're Elisa's boyfriend.

06:43.827 --> 06:45.577
Am I understanding correctly?

06:45.657 --> 06:46.577
Yes.

06:48.377 --> 06:49.997
[ELISA]
I'm so sorry about earlier.

06:50.087 --> 06:52.207
No, I don't really mind.

06:52.297 --> 06:53.337
It's just...

06:53.417 --> 06:54.377
What's up?

06:54.467 --> 06:56.467
It all happened so fast.

06:56.547 --> 06:58.547
I just felt like everyone there
was looking at me

06:58.637 --> 07:02.137
like I was some sort of oddity,
and I panicked.

07:03.177 --> 07:04.727
To help Elisa,

07:04.807 --> 07:07.347
I want to play the role
of her boyfriend perfectly.

07:07.437 --> 07:09.647
Understood. So then,

07:10.317 --> 07:13.067
what level of courtship
are you attempting to emulate?

07:13.147 --> 07:15.027
How did you two grow so close?

07:15.107 --> 07:16.857
What kind of dates
does Elisa like?

07:17.447 --> 07:18.737
Oh, I don't know.

07:18.817 --> 07:20.617
I haven't thought about
any of those things.

07:20.697 --> 07:21.907
I see.

07:22.237 --> 07:24.247
It sounds like you're going
to need a lot of coaching

07:24.327 --> 07:25.577
-to pull this off.
-[gasps]

07:25.657 --> 07:26.907
[RAY]
I appreciate your guidance.

07:26.997 --> 07:28.417
It can't be.

07:28.497 --> 07:31.457
Is Carla really so skilled
in the ways of romance?

07:31.537 --> 07:33.757
[CARLA]
Now let's begin with the basics.

07:33.837 --> 07:35.337
-Right.
-[slurps]

07:37.877 --> 07:39.837
[EVI] Talk about
an unexpected development.

07:40.427 --> 07:41.927
So you and Elisa, huh?

07:42.007 --> 07:43.887
When did it even start, man?

07:44.467 --> 07:47.437
Sorry.
I can't share the details.

07:47.517 --> 07:48.517
Oh.

07:48.597 --> 07:50.557
Still, that stuff
doesn't matter.

07:50.647 --> 07:52.147
We're rooting
for you two the whole way.

07:52.227 --> 07:53.147
Yeah!

07:53.227 --> 07:54.647
Thanks, you guys.

07:55.237 --> 07:56.567
[EVI] Well, then.

07:56.647 --> 07:57.647
It's about that time.

07:58.277 --> 08:00.157
-You're getting out already?
-Yep.

08:00.237 --> 08:01.407
If we can't get
the juicy deets--

08:01.487 --> 08:03.407
He means it's time
for us to go train.

08:03.487 --> 08:05.287
Uh, oh, right.

08:05.367 --> 08:06.447
We need to go train now.

08:07.117 --> 08:08.827
-[ALBERT] See you, Ray.
-[EVI] Later, dude.

08:08.907 --> 08:09.957
Uh, sure.

08:18.087 --> 08:20.427
-[MAN] So you're Ray White.
-Huh?

08:21.507 --> 08:22.587
I am.

08:22.677 --> 08:24.427
And who exactly are you?

08:24.507 --> 08:27.727
Greetings. I'm Marius Bassett.

08:27.807 --> 08:29.477
Marius!

08:29.557 --> 08:32.977
You're the sorcerer
of Phosphorescence?

08:33.057 --> 08:35.017
It's nice to meet you, Iceblade.

08:36.607 --> 08:39.987
And, uh, I'll be staying here
for a while as well.

08:40.067 --> 08:42.197
If you need anything,
just let me know.

08:42.277 --> 08:44.867
Oh, well,
thank you very much, sir.

08:44.947 --> 08:45.867
Hmm.

08:47.407 --> 08:50.157
I think I'll be heading out now.

08:53.667 --> 08:54.787
He overheated.

08:58.837 --> 08:59.837
Hmm?

08:59.917 --> 09:02.427
-[RAY] Oh, hey.
-What a coincidence.

09:02.507 --> 09:04.047
We just happened
to be walking by.

09:04.137 --> 09:06.257
-What are the odds?
-That so?

09:06.347 --> 09:11.017
Anyway, um, we wanted to ask
how you feel...

09:11.097 --> 09:12.227
Feel about what?

09:12.307 --> 09:14.557
We know you can't
share the details, but--

09:14.647 --> 09:16.227
Ray! What exactly is your stance

09:16.317 --> 09:18.487
on having a
romantic relationship?

09:19.027 --> 09:19.987
Hmm.

09:23.067 --> 09:24.987
-[RAY] I don't know.
-[all gasp]

09:25.407 --> 09:27.617
Even though
Carla has taught me a lot,

09:27.697 --> 09:29.747
I still haven't really
figured it all out.

09:29.827 --> 09:31.907
Oh, I see.

09:31.997 --> 09:33.747
Yeah, I think we get it now.

09:33.827 --> 09:35.247
Hmm?

09:35.337 --> 09:37.167
But it's really no big deal.

09:37.247 --> 09:38.457
We were just making sure

09:38.547 --> 09:40.587
everything was cool
to be on the safe side.

09:40.667 --> 09:41.627
[sighs]

09:42.127 --> 09:44.177
[CLARIS]
A romantic relationship, huh?

09:44.257 --> 09:46.007
I wonder how Elisa's feeling.

09:46.097 --> 09:47.757
-[teeth clattering]
-[grunts]

09:50.477 --> 09:51.847
[YAMO] Yamo.

09:52.427 --> 09:53.597
[MIA] Here we are.

09:53.687 --> 09:55.647
This will be your room
for the night, Ray.

09:55.727 --> 09:56.767
Good night.

09:56.857 --> 09:57.817
[door closes]

09:58.517 --> 09:59.567
Huh?

10:00.487 --> 10:02.317
[RAY] I'll go ahead
and sleep on the floor.

10:02.397 --> 10:04.197
I'm guessing
they arranged it this way

10:04.277 --> 10:06.117
because we're supposed
to be a couple.

10:06.197 --> 10:08.327
-But I don't mind.
-Hmm?

10:09.237 --> 10:12.537
You can stay in the bed with me
if you want.

10:13.657 --> 10:15.037
♪

10:15.747 --> 10:17.247
[ELISA] Hey, Ray. Are you awake?

10:18.837 --> 10:19.797
Yeah.

10:20.377 --> 10:23.417
I wanted to apologize again.

10:23.507 --> 10:24.757
No, it's totally fine.

10:24.837 --> 10:26.337
But...

10:26.427 --> 10:28.257
Like I said, we're friends.

10:28.347 --> 10:30.557
If you ever need my help,
you can ask anytime.

10:30.637 --> 10:31.677
Hmm.

10:31.767 --> 10:32.977
Besides,

10:33.057 --> 10:35.687
I prefer words of gratitude
over an apology.

10:35.767 --> 10:38.227
-Gratitude?
-Yeah.

10:38.307 --> 10:40.187
There's nothing you need to
apologize for.

10:40.267 --> 10:42.937
So you can just give me
a "thank you" instead.

10:43.027 --> 10:44.697
That's more than enough.

10:44.777 --> 10:45.897
Okay, then.

10:46.447 --> 10:49.657
-Ray, thank you.
-My pleasure.

10:49.737 --> 10:51.327
[CAROL]
I never would've suspected

10:51.407 --> 10:53.707
that Elisa was
Alpheria's fourth princess.

10:53.787 --> 10:55.907
Abbie, did you know about this?

10:55.997 --> 10:59.457
More or less.
I am the principal after all.

10:59.537 --> 11:01.337
[CAROL] Amazing as always.

11:01.417 --> 11:03.917
But the sudden timing
of all this makes me suspicious

11:04.007 --> 11:06.297
that there may be
some hidden agenda at play.

11:07.797 --> 11:09.547
Yeah, it's possible.

11:09.637 --> 11:13.137
But still,
that girl doesn't have it easy.

11:13.217 --> 11:15.557
Whatever happens is sure
to put her to the test.

11:15.637 --> 11:16.557
You know?

11:19.557 --> 11:20.477
[RAY] Elisa.

11:21.107 --> 11:22.937
Hey, Elisa, wake up.

11:23.027 --> 11:26.447
[groans]

11:29.157 --> 11:31.447
Oh, Ray. Good morning.

11:31.527 --> 11:33.827
Yeah, good morning.

11:33.907 --> 11:34.867
By the way,

11:35.497 --> 11:37.327
you should probably close up
the buttons over your chest.

11:37.407 --> 11:38.287
Uh.

11:39.787 --> 11:40.787
[gasps]

11:43.877 --> 11:45.207
It's gorgeous outside.

11:45.297 --> 11:47.507
How about we go on a date?

11:47.587 --> 11:49.087
[echoes] Ba-dump!

11:49.177 --> 11:50.467
Dump! Dump!

11:53.757 --> 11:54.767
[RAY] Here.

11:55.427 --> 11:57.477
-Huh?
-What's wrong?

11:57.557 --> 11:59.727
We're supposed to be
in a relationship, right?

11:59.807 --> 12:01.267
When walking outside,

12:01.357 --> 12:03.897
it's perfectly natural
for couples to hold hands,

12:03.977 --> 12:05.237
I think.

12:05.857 --> 12:07.817
A date requires holding hands.

12:07.897 --> 12:10.277
Be sure
to escort her skillfully.

12:10.907 --> 12:13.487
-Oh, sorry. Do you not want to?
-Huh?

12:13.577 --> 12:15.037
[groans]

12:16.907 --> 12:18.997
I'm fine. Let's do it.

12:22.747 --> 12:24.457
-[TOURY] Wee!
-[SUGARI] Toury!

12:24.537 --> 12:25.667
[TOURY] What's up, Sugari?

12:25.757 --> 12:26.757
[SUGARI] I love you!

12:26.837 --> 12:29.927
-I love you, too.
-[BOTH] Yay!

12:30.337 --> 12:32.757
♪

12:34.847 --> 12:35.967
Hmm.

12:36.057 --> 12:37.847
[CARLA]
A gentleman must also take care

12:37.927 --> 12:40.097
to adjust his gait
to the lady's.

12:40.637 --> 12:42.517
[water splashing]

12:44.107 --> 12:46.687
At times, showing off
your physical prowess

12:46.777 --> 12:48.027
is also important.

12:51.147 --> 12:54.027
Doing so allows your partner
to feel at ease

12:54.117 --> 12:55.617
and relaxed on the date.

12:59.957 --> 13:01.037
[Elisa gasps]

13:01.117 --> 13:02.707
They look amazing.

13:02.787 --> 13:04.787
I know I've seen them
in textbooks,

13:04.877 --> 13:06.877
but I've never seen them
in person before.

13:07.507 --> 13:08.757
[GIRL 3] Look, the Princess.

13:08.837 --> 13:09.917
[BOY 3] Oh, it is!

13:10.007 --> 13:12.297
-[boy 3 gasps]
-Hello, Princess!

13:12.387 --> 13:14.467
-Wow, pretty.
-So lovely.

13:14.547 --> 13:15.677
[boys gasp]

13:16.007 --> 13:17.927
[RAY] Looks like even these kids
know who you are.

13:18.557 --> 13:19.847
[ELISA] Well, I, um--

13:20.137 --> 13:22.597
So, I'm pretty sure you two
are a couple, aren't you?

13:22.687 --> 13:23.557
[Elisa gasps]

13:23.647 --> 13:24.857
[GIRL 4] Don't be shy.

13:24.937 --> 13:27.147
Spill the beans.
How far have you two gone?

13:27.227 --> 13:28.817
Yeah, how far?

13:28.897 --> 13:30.897
-Holding hands, is that it?
-[BOY 3] Whoa, whoa.

13:30.987 --> 13:33.317
-Have you two shared a bed?
-[BOY 3] Woo-hoo.

13:33.407 --> 13:34.817
Bed? Really?

13:34.907 --> 13:37.617
[BOTH]
Then after that. Kissy, kissy.

13:37.697 --> 13:38.827
And other stuff.

13:38.907 --> 13:41.327
Kiss. [groans]

13:41.407 --> 13:43.207
Elisa, are you okay?

13:44.327 --> 13:46.337
-I'm sorry. Excuse us.
-[gasps]

13:46.417 --> 13:48.757
I'm afraid
the princess is tired.

13:48.837 --> 13:50.377
It's time for us to leave.

13:50.467 --> 13:51.837
[KIDS] Bye!

13:54.137 --> 13:55.387
[GIRL 3] Feast your eyes.

13:55.467 --> 13:58.257
Now, that is how
a real man carries a princess.

13:58.347 --> 14:00.727
-For sure.
-[RAY] Oh, I see.

14:00.807 --> 14:03.727
It appears that elves tend to be
older than they look.

14:03.807 --> 14:05.977
[birds cawing]

14:07.307 --> 14:08.477
[groans]

14:10.227 --> 14:13.147
-What just happened?
-How do you feel?

14:13.237 --> 14:14.277
Um.

14:14.697 --> 14:17.657
-No, I'm, I'm sorry. I just--
-Everything's fine.

14:20.657 --> 14:21.997
It's not easy.

14:22.077 --> 14:24.867
Feels like we always
have to put on a show.

14:24.957 --> 14:27.997
Pretending like we're a couple,
it's hard.

14:29.087 --> 14:31.457
Oh, that is so true.

14:34.627 --> 14:35.587
[Elisa grunts]

14:36.637 --> 14:38.257
-[Ray gasps]
-It's hard.

14:39.717 --> 14:41.517
But since we're here,
can I practice more?

14:41.597 --> 14:44.517
Uh, yeah. That's fine.

14:44.597 --> 14:46.807
[CATHY] You, stop right there.

14:46.897 --> 14:49.727
[RAY] Cathy, the Third Princess.

14:49.817 --> 14:50.857
[scoffs]

14:51.147 --> 14:53.277
You're the one
who claims to be her boyfriend.

14:53.357 --> 14:54.277
Is that correct?

14:54.357 --> 14:55.737
Yes, that's right.

14:55.817 --> 14:57.157
[CATHY] I can't believe
you have the nerve

14:57.237 --> 14:58.527
to be so shameless.

14:58.617 --> 15:00.447
I saw you yesterday.

15:00.527 --> 15:01.787
Strolling around in public,

15:01.867 --> 15:03.577
having fun
with a group of human girls.

15:03.657 --> 15:04.827
Unfaithful swine.

15:04.907 --> 15:06.157
You're nothing but a cheater.

15:06.247 --> 15:07.747
[ALL] Unfaithful swine!

15:07.827 --> 15:09.287
You're nothing but a cheater.

15:09.377 --> 15:12.127
-[CATHY] We see you, cheater.
-[ALL] Yeah, cheater.

15:12.207 --> 15:13.297
[RAY] Oh!

15:13.377 --> 15:15.547
You saw me with good friends.

15:15.627 --> 15:17.007
There's no cheating, I swear.

15:17.087 --> 15:18.087
[CATHY] Shut up and listen!

15:18.427 --> 15:20.507
Ever since I found out
I had a little sister,

15:20.597 --> 15:22.467
I've been ecstatic.
From that moment on,

15:22.557 --> 15:23.807
I swore that
I would take care of her

15:23.887 --> 15:25.097
no matter what happens.

15:25.177 --> 15:26.937
I mean, who wouldn't want
a new little sister

15:27.017 --> 15:29.897
to hang out with,
to brush her hair, dress her up.

15:29.977 --> 15:31.267
How great that must be!

15:31.357 --> 15:32.937
Yes, I would do everything
in my power

15:33.017 --> 15:34.147
to make her feel at home

15:34.237 --> 15:36.147
and help her fall in love
with Alpheria.

15:36.237 --> 15:38.317
And so, why is this happening?

15:38.407 --> 15:39.907
Why show up
with a human boyfriend

15:39.987 --> 15:41.197
after all these years?

15:42.327 --> 15:45.407
Even then, I tried to get it.
I really did.

15:45.497 --> 15:47.207
I said, "Since she picked him,

15:47.287 --> 15:49.127
he couldn't be
such a terrible guy.

15:49.207 --> 15:50.207
There's no way."

15:50.287 --> 15:51.877
But now I see how wrong I was.

15:51.957 --> 15:54.127
You're just a womanizer!

15:54.207 --> 15:56.297
Hey, Princess,
we don't say that anymore.

15:56.377 --> 15:58.627
-Womanizer?
-No, it's gotta go.

15:58.717 --> 16:01.217
[groans] May you sink
to the depths of hell,

16:01.297 --> 16:02.637
you philandering crow!

16:03.757 --> 16:06.137
You are not worthy of my trust
or much else.

16:06.227 --> 16:07.177
It is crystal clear

16:07.557 --> 16:09.387
that your heart does not beat
for Elisa alone.

16:10.057 --> 16:11.477
Uh, Princess Cathy, can I--

16:11.557 --> 16:13.187
[RAY] That is not true.

16:13.267 --> 16:15.987
In fact,
I love Elisa with all my heart.

16:16.067 --> 16:17.607
[Elisa gasps]

16:19.197 --> 16:20.157
Elisa?

16:20.237 --> 16:21.657
-Oh, please.
-Elisa, are you okay?

16:21.737 --> 16:24.577
You're all talk,
but if you're the real deal...

16:24.657 --> 16:25.907
-[RAY] Elisa?
-...then there is something

16:25.997 --> 16:27.367
you could do
to maybe convince me

16:27.457 --> 16:29.077
that you're not totally
full of it.

16:29.157 --> 16:30.117
Like a trial.

16:30.957 --> 16:33.417
-A trial? Really?
-That's right.

16:33.497 --> 16:36.127
Parade Forest is one of the
most dangerous places

16:36.207 --> 16:37.587
in all of Alpheria.

16:37.667 --> 16:39.927
So if you want
to prove your devotion to Elisa,

16:40.007 --> 16:42.257
you can bring me a mandrake
from that forest.

16:42.347 --> 16:43.637
Just a mandrake?

16:43.717 --> 16:45.967
Even amongst
the most seasoned of elves,

16:46.057 --> 16:48.427
digging up a mandrake root
is considered a difficult trial.

16:48.517 --> 16:49.937
And why is that?

16:50.017 --> 16:51.847
When you wrestle the mandrake
from the soil...

16:51.937 --> 16:53.767
It lets out a hideous,
blood-curdling scream!

16:53.857 --> 16:55.607
Your eardrums will explode,
and then you'll face...

16:55.687 --> 16:58.147
A thoroughly unpleasant
experience, to say the least!

16:58.237 --> 17:00.567
So are you terrified
beyond doubt?

17:00.647 --> 17:03.067
If it sounds impossible,
it's because it is.

17:03.157 --> 17:04.737
But I will not
allow anything less

17:04.827 --> 17:06.787
than the power
to protect Alpherian royalty.

17:06.867 --> 17:07.867
Do you understand me?

17:07.947 --> 17:10.537
So if you'd like to cry,
apologize,

17:10.617 --> 17:11.787
and break it off with her now--

17:11.867 --> 17:13.287
-[RAY] Challenge accepted.
-Huh?

17:13.377 --> 17:15.087
You want a mandrake?

17:15.167 --> 17:16.587
Then consider it done.

17:16.667 --> 17:17.997
I'll begin preparations
right away

17:18.087 --> 17:19.007
and leave early
tomorrow morning.

17:19.087 --> 17:20.547
[CATHY] Wait, what? Really?

17:21.167 --> 17:22.387
[RAY] Is there a time limit?

17:22.717 --> 17:23.717
[gasps]

17:24.347 --> 17:27.847
Oh, uh, you have until dusk,
I guess.

17:27.927 --> 17:29.097
Till dusk?

17:29.847 --> 17:30.767
I'll get it.

17:35.817 --> 17:37.317
[RAY] I'm sorry, Mia.

17:37.397 --> 17:40.027
I'll be staying here tonight
to prep for tomorrow.

17:40.647 --> 17:42.197
Please look after Elisa.

17:42.947 --> 17:44.817
Sure, I'll take care of her.

17:46.327 --> 17:49.197
[sighs] I'm alone again.

17:50.407 --> 17:52.207
-[knocks]
-Hmm?

17:53.707 --> 17:55.327
Huh? [gasps]

17:55.837 --> 17:58.667
-Claris?
-You caught me.

17:59.797 --> 18:01.547
[CLARIS] Oh, I get it.

18:01.627 --> 18:03.127
Without knowing why,
I was surprised to hear

18:03.217 --> 18:05.257
that Ray accepted
your sister's trial.

18:05.887 --> 18:08.467
Yeah, it was decided
before I woke up.

18:08.557 --> 18:10.137
Woke up from what, exactly?

18:10.717 --> 18:11.977
Did I say woke up?

18:12.057 --> 18:13.517
I was just distracted.

18:14.097 --> 18:16.937
-Hmm.
-Look, since I came to Alpheria,

18:17.017 --> 18:19.277
everything has felt
completely overwhelming

18:20.857 --> 18:23.527
And then, I dragged Ray
into the situation,

18:23.607 --> 18:25.277
and now
I'm causing him problems.

18:25.357 --> 18:27.947
It's hard.
I don't know what to do.

18:28.027 --> 18:29.787
I wouldn't worry if I were you.

18:29.867 --> 18:32.407
It's Ray. He'll be fine
no matter what happens.

18:32.497 --> 18:33.997
-Yeah, but...
-[knocks on door]

18:34.077 --> 18:35.037
[BOTH] Huh?

18:35.497 --> 18:38.037
[MIA] Hey, Elisa.
Is someone in there with you?

18:38.127 --> 18:40.497
Uh, in here?
No, I'm talking to myself.

18:40.587 --> 18:42.007
[MIA] Oh, all right.

18:42.087 --> 18:44.837
Well, would you like us
to bring dinner to your room?

18:44.917 --> 18:46.797
No, I'll come down to eat,
thanks.

18:46.887 --> 18:48.677
[MIA] As you wish.
Then I will go prepare.

18:48.757 --> 18:49.847
[CLARIS] Oh, well, I should go.

18:50.347 --> 18:52.267
-[ELISA] I'm okay. Thank you.
-[CLARIS] See you tomorrow.

18:52.347 --> 18:53.847
Wait, tomorrow?

18:53.927 --> 18:55.937
So does that mean
you're coming, too?

18:56.727 --> 18:58.517
Isn't that what good friends do?

19:06.147 --> 19:08.737
[thunder rumbling]

19:08.817 --> 19:10.277
♪

19:10.947 --> 19:11.907
Right.

19:25.587 --> 19:26.547
[Bianca sighs]

19:26.927 --> 19:29.097
I was worried
he might have seen us just then,

19:29.177 --> 19:31.137
but it looks like we're okay.

19:31.217 --> 19:33.267
So, that place you mentioned,

19:33.807 --> 19:35.637
did you say
it's in the back there?

19:35.727 --> 19:37.977
Well, it doesn't matter to me.

19:38.057 --> 19:39.647
I won't interfere
with your work.

19:39.727 --> 19:42.107
I just need you to do your part
without messing up.

19:44.777 --> 19:47.147
You deaf?
Why are you not saying anything?

19:47.237 --> 19:49.067
Don't flash your eyes
at me like that.

19:49.157 --> 19:50.777
You're too focused
on your facade.

19:50.867 --> 19:52.117
I just can't with you.

19:54.287 --> 19:57.157
The forest seems
particularly inhospitable today.

19:57.247 --> 19:58.867
If he thinks
he's finding a mandrake

19:58.957 --> 20:01.127
in these conditions, he's crazy.

20:01.207 --> 20:04.087
Now, that said, did he go?
Really?

20:04.167 --> 20:06.707
Yes. He went in. It's confirmed.

20:06.797 --> 20:09.047
[CATHY] Is he going to be okay?

20:09.137 --> 20:10.177
He did?

20:10.257 --> 20:12.217
-What now?
-Don't worry about a thing.

20:12.297 --> 20:13.347
It's Ray.

20:14.557 --> 20:15.967
-Huh?
-[Claris sighs]

20:16.057 --> 20:18.387
-Look! Over there.
-Uh.

20:19.347 --> 20:20.647
[ELISA] It's Ray!

20:20.727 --> 20:23.647
-[CLARIS] Ray! [chuckles]
-[ELISA] You made it!

20:23.727 --> 20:25.227
I'm sorry you had to wait.

20:25.317 --> 20:26.857
[Cathy chuckles]

20:26.937 --> 20:28.647
I knew you'd give up
and come back fast.

20:28.737 --> 20:31.027
I'll admit,
that's very sensible of you.

20:31.117 --> 20:33.447
-No, I got it.
-Huh?

20:33.527 --> 20:35.987
But how did you do that
so quickly?

20:36.077 --> 20:38.867
I just went over there,
grabbed one, and came back.

20:38.957 --> 20:40.747
-Just like that?
-Yeah.

20:41.377 --> 20:43.207
You... Hey, now. [groans]

20:43.287 --> 20:44.417
That's heavy.

20:44.497 --> 20:46.747
But that's not possible.

20:48.627 --> 20:49.967
[all gasp]

20:50.047 --> 20:51.337
[CATHY] I see what you did.

20:51.427 --> 20:53.507
You just took some grass
and shoved it in a bag.

20:54.387 --> 20:55.927
You see? What'd I...

20:56.017 --> 20:57.017
Huh?

20:57.517 --> 21:00.807
-[roars]
-[screams]

21:00.887 --> 21:01.847
[mandrake continues roaring]

21:01.937 --> 21:03.267
-[RAY] Princess!
-[ELISA] Cathy!

21:03.357 --> 21:04.517
[TORIMAKI] Princess Cathy!

21:06.357 --> 21:07.977
[CATHY] I can see the light.

21:11.067 --> 21:12.277
First off,

21:13.027 --> 21:15.117
I'd like to thank you all
for being here.

21:15.197 --> 21:17.037
Why are we using my room
for this?

21:17.117 --> 21:18.037
[REBECCA] Now then,

21:18.117 --> 21:19.697
how is everyone else feeling

21:19.787 --> 21:21.327
about the current state
of affairs?

21:21.407 --> 21:24.747
Well, personally,
I think it's pretty terrible.

21:24.837 --> 21:25.917
[REBECCA] Indeed.

21:25.997 --> 21:27.547
This is an extremely grave
situation.

21:28.247 --> 21:30.797
It's not that I don't want Ray
to have a romantic awakening.

21:30.877 --> 21:32.547
In fact, I wouldn't mind that.

21:32.637 --> 21:35.427
It's just, not like this,
you know?

21:35.507 --> 21:37.597
Not while he's staying
with Elisa.

21:38.387 --> 21:40.267
Do you realize
how bad that would be?

21:40.347 --> 21:42.097
Possibly the worst thing ever.

21:42.187 --> 21:44.767
Those two could imprint
on each other.

21:45.897 --> 21:47.147
[gasps]

21:47.227 --> 21:49.817
If they imprint,
they'll be in love forever.

21:50.567 --> 21:52.397
So what can we do to stop them?

21:52.487 --> 21:54.567
There's plenty of options
at our disposal.

21:55.157 --> 21:56.577
To help gather intel,

21:56.657 --> 21:58.947
I've got Claris watching them
from the inside.

21:59.037 --> 22:00.077
[door opens, closes]

22:00.157 --> 22:02.327
I heard every single word
you said.

22:03.077 --> 22:04.827
I guess that means
all of you are my rivals,

22:04.917 --> 22:06.667
and we're competing
for the same guy.

22:06.747 --> 22:08.837
[all gasp]

22:09.877 --> 22:11.007
Wouldn't you know it,

22:11.087 --> 22:13.547
I was running an investigation
of my own.

22:13.627 --> 22:14.757
[elf chuckles]

22:16.007 --> 22:17.887
Perhaps it's best
that we cooperate.

22:20.767 --> 22:22.177
You passed the trial,

22:22.267 --> 22:24.097
but I can't
assess your true abilities

22:24.187 --> 22:25.897
or intent
with the mandrake alone.

22:25.977 --> 22:27.477
You tell him, Princess.

22:27.567 --> 22:28.897
[RAY] So what does that mean?

22:28.977 --> 22:30.317
That going forward,

22:30.397 --> 22:32.897
I will be keeping an eye
on you, up close.

22:32.987 --> 22:34.607
-It's your next trial.
-[both chuckle]

22:35.357 --> 22:36.447
Got it.

22:37.117 --> 22:38.407
-You're all smiles right now...
-[ALL THREE] But it won't last.

22:38.947 --> 22:40.287
Will Ray be all right?

22:40.367 --> 22:42.117
It's him. He'll be fine.

22:42.787 --> 22:43.747
Mmm.

22:45.867 --> 22:47.877
[CATHY] A man can dig, sure,
but can he fish?

22:48.627 --> 22:50.417
-[RAY] Job complete.
-[CATHY] That's a lot!

22:50.917 --> 22:52.917
Sure, but do you know
how to prepare them, though?

22:53.627 --> 22:54.717
[RAY] Grilled to perfection.

22:55.297 --> 22:56.887
Oh, I'll be the judge of that.

22:57.967 --> 22:59.557
[whimpers] It is perfection.

22:59.637 --> 23:01.137
[TORIMAKI]
It's so salty and delicious.

23:02.097 --> 23:03.387
You do fine around us,

23:03.467 --> 23:05.137
but what about
our senior friends?

23:05.227 --> 23:06.267
[RAY] Game.

23:06.727 --> 23:08.307
Oh, you got him.

23:08.397 --> 23:10.147
[Seniors chuckle]

23:10.227 --> 23:11.897
[grunts] Good with them, too?

23:11.977 --> 23:14.607
-Have I proven myself now?
-[CATHY] No, not yet.

23:14.687 --> 23:15.857
Not yet. Not yet!

23:17.317 --> 23:18.567
I folded everything.

23:19.327 --> 23:20.697
And I finished
all the cleaning, too.

23:20.777 --> 23:23.947
-[ELISA] Oh, Ray.
-Wow, I give him a ten-plus!

23:24.037 --> 23:26.457
He's perfect at cleaning
and doing the laundry, too.

23:26.537 --> 23:27.747
[Cathy whimpers]

23:28.287 --> 23:29.917
[CATHY] Not a fault to be found.

23:29.997 --> 23:31.587
None. None.

23:31.667 --> 23:35.167
None. None. None.

23:35.257 --> 23:37.927
[♪ closing theme song playing]

23:48.807 --> 23:52.107
I am Cathy Alpherius,
Elisa's adorable older sis.

23:52.187 --> 23:53.937
[ELFS] You're so great
you can't be missed.

23:54.027 --> 23:55.607
-I'm Elisa.
-And I'm Claris.

23:55.687 --> 23:57.067
[CATHY] Don't go thinking
that you've won this.

23:57.147 --> 23:58.907
[ELFS] It's not over,
that's just hubris!

23:58.987 --> 24:00.067
- Nice! Nice!
-[CATHY] Is he? Could be.

24:00.157 --> 24:00.947
-[CATHY] Carry me.
-[ELISA] Tonight.

24:01.027 --> 24:02.027
[CATHY] Need to be. Make it.

24:02.117 --> 24:03.077
[CATHY] Go forth and die.

24:03.157 --> 24:04.077
[CATHY] Next time on...

24:04.697 --> 24:07.077
[ELFS] The Iceblade Sorcerer
Shall Rule the World Two!

24:07.157 --> 24:09.077
[CATHY] We'll keep on going
in episode six!

24:09.167 --> 24:11.087
The Boy Who Is the World's
Strongest Sorcerer...

24:11.167 --> 24:12.917
[ELISA, CLARIS]
Faces the Incoming Trials!
